WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:06.430
Hey Youtubers it’s Charlie and during my
Arrow review I asked you all to submit questions

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:10.710
about the epic mess that Slade is making for
Team Arrow the rest of the season.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.849
I picked 10 to answer in this video with one
bonus question.

00:00:12.849 --> 00:00:17.580
I tried to stick to the most important things
like new characters, team-ups and related

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.949
Flash news.

00:00:18.949 --> 00:00:22.941
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do Q&amp;A videos for big shows just so that

00:00:22.941 --> 00:00:25.770
we can talk a little more about the most interesting
parts.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.170
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.890
So let’s answer some questions.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:36.270
Number 1 - CountSwagula asks Maybe episode
20 "Seeing Red" could be Roy's first appearance

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.280
as Red Arrow.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.770
Either Barry Allen coming back or Roy putting
on the tights?

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.810
Good question.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:46.460
There are two things we know, Roy will get
his suit and characters from The Flash are

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:50.370
coming to Arrow or back to Arrow, before the
end of the season.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:53.350
So like a lot of episode titles I think it
means both things.

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:57.030
There is still a special announcement that
goes hand in hand with episode 20 and it has

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:01.940
a lot to do with episode 19 and the potential
for a supporting character to die.

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:07.380
A lot of the questions tie back into this
so I’ll be elaborating throughout the rest

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.000
of the Q&amp;A.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:14.950
Question 2 - Tom Steven asks I thought it
would be 20 episodes in season 2?

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:18.700
There are currently 23 listed on The Futon
Critic right now.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.350
So what’s happening is there’s a break
next week.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:26.700
Then on March 19th there’s episode 15 the
Suicide Squad and every week after that will

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.509
be a new episode until the finale.

00:01:29.509 --> 00:01:32.369
Episode 23 on May 14th.

00:01:32.369 --> 00:01:36.670
We only know the titles of the episodes up
to 18 and episode 20.

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:42.540
In order those are, Suicide Squad, Birds of
Prey, Deathstroke and Seeing Red.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:46.590
We don’t know the names of episodes 19 or
the last 4 yet.

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:53.380
Question 3 - Red Arrow 1596 asks Do you think
Amanda Waller will approach Slade in the season

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:57.810
finale and ask him to join the Suicide Squad,
and what do you think their potential is for

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:01.249
becoming a sort of altogether Big Bad for
Season 3?﻿

00:02:01.249 --> 00:02:05.079
So you’re asking if Slade is ever going
to join the Suicide Squad and if they’re

00:02:05.079 --> 00:02:08.770
going to be the villains in season 3.

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:14.030
I can say probably not to the first part and
definitely no to the second.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:16.950
The Suicide Squad are great anti-hero’s.

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:20.250
Those are protagonists that aren’t necessarily
good guys.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:23.640
Like evil people working with the good guys
toward a common goal.

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:25.700
Under a temporary cease fire.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:30.000
It’s possible that members of the Suicide
Squad could go rogue in the future, but then

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.720
Amanda Waller would just send the rest of
the Squad to kill or capture them.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:37.670
I’ll talk more about potential Big Bads
for Season 3 when we get closer to the Finale.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:41.480
There’s still a lot we don’t know about
how this season is going to end.

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:46.070
Question 4 - Sarah Sunshine (no avatar) asks
Do you think that it is possible to see Slades

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:49.350
children sometime later during the shows run,
like Rose or Jericho?﻿

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:53.070
Thank you for asking this question because
I was just thinking about a Darth Vader arc

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.270
for Slade.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:58.951
What I mean is that Darth Vader starts out
as a good person, Anakin Skywalker, and when

00:02:58.951 --> 00:03:03.340
you watch the Star Wars movies starting with
episode 1 and ending with Return of The Jedi,

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:06.760
the overarching story becomes The Redemption
of Vader.

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:10.570
So all of Star Wars isn’t Luke’s story,
it’s really the story of Vader’s fall

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:13.150
from grace and ultimate redemption.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:15.930
What happened to cause Vader to seek redemption.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:17.310
His children showed up.

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:21.230
In the comics Slade’s children pretty much
hate him for being so evil.

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:24.940
But we don’t really know how Arrow is going
to deal with that relationship.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:28.820
Slade was lying when he said he didn’t have
any children during the last episode.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:32.030
Oliver specifically mention Jericho on the
island in episode 12.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:35.940
It was when Slade first started to freak out
on the Mirakuru.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:41.010
In the comics he had another son, Grant the
first Ravager who died and a daughter Rose,

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:43.680
who became the second Ravager after her brother’s
death.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:47.240
They’re kind of like a backdoor to a Teen
Titan’s show with Roy Harper.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:51.570
I’m crossing my fingers that Arrow goes
the Darth Vader-route with Slade.

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:54.850
With the exception being Slade isn’t going
to die at the end.

00:03:54.850 --> 00:04:00.520
Question 5 - Icewhitescarab asks Because there
was a girl with blonde hair and black fingernails

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:06.100
do you think Harley Quinn will be introduced
in the Suicide Squad episode?﻿

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:10.031
I definitely think it’s Harley Quinn, there
are a couple other theories but based on the

00:04:10.031 --> 00:04:14.740
Nail polish and the link to the comic books
it makes a lot of sense given the big moments

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:19.009
Arrow has already given us with other A-List
supers like The Flash this season.

00:04:19.009 --> 00:04:21.590
There’s even a bigger character coming in
the finale.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.900
Which I will speechify in a little bit.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:29.020
Question 6 - Michael Hernandez (no avatar)
asks Could the blonde girl in the jail cell

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:31.389
be Terra instead of Harley Quinn?

00:04:31.389 --> 00:04:34.169
Tera does have a partnership with Deathstroke
in the comics.

00:04:34.169 --> 00:04:36.770
It’s definitely another possibility.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:42.040
Remember in episode 12 Tremors the earthquake
machine was being bought by someone in Markovia,

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.990
that would have been Terra’s father.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:48.659
In the comics she started working with Deathstroke
and inflitrated the Teen Titans for him.

00:04:48.659 --> 00:04:53.070
Hey, I guess if it does turn out crazy hair
is really Terra it would be more evidence

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:56.300
that the CW is trying to develop a Teen Titans
show.

00:04:56.300 --> 00:05:03.150
Question 7 - jkfg989 asks Do you think it
is a possibility that Felicity might be Ivo's

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.630
daughter?

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:10.669
This is a really good theory, the backstory
Felicity has given us lines up with a lot

00:05:10.669 --> 00:05:12.569
of what we know about Ivo on the show.

00:05:12.569 --> 00:05:17.520
And it would be one more way to make her part
of Slade completing this full circle revenge

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.289
that started with Shado’s death back on
the island.

00:05:19.289 --> 00:05:21.731
I definitely think it would add a really nice
dimension to Felicity’s character.

00:05:21.731 --> 00:05:23.040
Give her a darker edge and an arc for Season
3.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:27.000
The big question though is what happened to
Ivo after Slade chopped his hand off?

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:31.189
He didn’t die and the episode kind of cut
off in the middle of that story.

00:05:31.189 --> 00:05:36.729
Question 8 - Shihab Shabir asks Do you think
Malcolm Merlin will appear in this "villain

00:05:36.729 --> 00:05:37.770
arc"﻿
.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.629
He has to come back at some point.

00:05:39.629 --> 00:05:41.000
There are a couple of theories.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.590
He could be working on his own to win over
Thea.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:49.509
He does care about family, he went nuts when
Tommy died and the only reason he came back

00:05:49.509 --> 00:05:50.789
was for Thea.

00:05:50.789 --> 00:05:55.960
The other possibility is he’s working with
Slade and using the opportunity to win Thea

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:56.960
over.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.110
Remember, he doesn’t want to hurt her.

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:00.229
I don’t think this is a good theory though.

00:06:00.229 --> 00:06:03.680
And we know he’s keeping his distance from
the League of Assassin’s.

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:06.849
But during Heir to the Demon, Sara name dropped
him.

00:06:06.849 --> 00:06:10.969
So when Merlyn does come back, and he will,
expect that the League won’t be too far

00:06:10.969 --> 00:06:14.349
behind him, either to stop him or to help
him.

00:06:14.349 --> 00:06:18.870
His character is linked closely with them
this season.

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:24.759
Question 9 - Elena Podadic asks When Flash
starts will it work with Arrow's storyline

00:06:24.759 --> 00:06:28.820
or will it have it's own, so it’s easier
to follow for people who don’t watch Arrow?

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:34.360
Yes, you will be able to watch The Flash without
watching Arrow, but you’d be missing so

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.960
many easter eggs and references.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:41.389
Characters from both shows will jump back
and forth so I’d say to watch Arrow.

00:06:41.389 --> 00:06:42.389
It’s so good.

00:06:42.389 --> 00:06:45.419
I’m guessing the reason you’re asking
is because you or someone you know is a huge

00:06:45.419 --> 00:06:47.861
Grant Gustin fan, but not a fan of the people
on Arrow.

00:06:47.861 --> 00:06:51.479
That’s totally okay, but Arrow is a lot
of fun so you should tell your friends they

00:06:51.479 --> 00:06:53.900
should totally drink the kool-aide.

00:06:53.900 --> 00:07:01.409
Question 10 - Bang Maid asks Do you think
a series of events culminating with Sara dying

00:07:01.409 --> 00:07:06.350
and Laurel being injected with Mirakuru and
becoming Black Canary?﻿

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:10.860
So Marc Guggenheim said there’s a special
announcement about episode 19.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:15.860
He used this Aaron Sorkin quote about an episode
of the West Wing where one of the characters

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:16.860
dies.

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:22.279
We don’t know what the announcement is,
but based on the West Wing reference it sounds

00:07:22.279 --> 00:07:24.729
like someone from Team Arrow will die.

00:07:24.729 --> 00:07:29.110
Right now the biggest possibilities from least
likely to most likely are:

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:33.759
Laurel Thea and then Sara.

00:07:33.759 --> 00:07:38.900
So yes, Sara is highest on my hit-list, it
would fit thematically with Slade completing

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.910
his circle of revenge.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:44.440
Making Oliver choose whether he kills Sara
or Laurel.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.229
The same way Shado died.

00:07:46.229 --> 00:07:49.819
Another possibility is that Thea dies and
Merlyn calls down the League of Assassin’s

00:07:49.819 --> 00:07:50.830
on Slade.

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:53.610
That’s not as likely because remember Oliver’s
quote.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:56.319
Ra’s Al Ghul would be trouble for everyone.

00:07:56.319 --> 00:07:58.509
Heroes and Villains.

00:07:58.509 --> 00:08:02.809
Manu Bennett said that he would be coming
to Starling.

00:08:02.809 --> 00:08:08.949
Marc Guggeheim kind of teased a major surprise
like this in the finale.

00:08:08.949 --> 00:08:13.699
But it depended on a bunch of stuff working
out behind the scenes.

00:08:13.699 --> 00:08:15.360
So it could still fall through.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.039
So yes, he’s coming.

00:08:17.039 --> 00:08:20.479
But it’s not official until the Arrow people
make the annoucement.

00:08:20.479 --> 00:08:23.460
But they’re doing everything they can to
use the character on the show.

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:27.960
No idea on who would play him or whether it
would be Liam Neeson reprising the role.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:29.300
Probably not.

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:35.240
and one last Bonus Question - Vijay Krishnan
asks Who do you think was the person who knocked

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:36.240
out Diggle?

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.240
That’s actually the Huntress.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:42.340
If you look closely she’s got belt buckles
here and the stick weapons that look like

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:44.970
the ones in the clips from the Birds of Prey
episode.

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:49.690
So thank you so much for submitting questions
guys this was a lot of fun and thank you for

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.010
your patience.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:56.100
I’ve had a ton of real life work this week
and it makes it really hard to get videos

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.100
out on time.

00:08:57.100 --> 00:09:00.930
Tonight I’m going to try and catch up on
Community and Hannibal videos.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.550
That might spill over into Saturday.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:08.690
I also owe you guys South Park Stick of Truth,
new Doctor Who, Game of Thrones and Anime

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:09.690
Club before Monday.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:13.650
I’ll try and spread it all out.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.160
If you’re just seeing me for the first time,
be sure to subscribe to get all that stuff.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.600
I have a lot of fun making it.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:21.209
Hopefully someday that will be my only job.

00:09:21.209 --> 00:09:25.610
Until then, click here to watch that epic
Arrow Movie Trailer again and click here for

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:26.820
my review of the episode.

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:28.940
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:29.350
High Fives!

